WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:08.166
Cora's cousin Octo was visiting.

2
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:12.582
Cora loved Octo.

3
00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:16.967
But he made lots of trouble.

4
00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:26.142
"Watch your arms!" Cora said.

5
00:00:26.143 --> 00:00:34.646
"Oops!" Octo broke one of Cora's shells. "Sorry!"

6
00:00:34.647 --> 00:00:42.407
"It's okay." Cora sighed. "Just be more careful."

7
00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:44.894
Mo swam into Cora's den.

8
00:00:44.895 --> 00:00:47.457
"Hi, Cora. Want to play?"

9
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:51.381
"Mo, this is my cousin Octo," Cora said.

10
00:00:51.382 --> 00:00:56.498
"I'll play!" Octo said. "Do you like tag?"

11
00:00:56.499 --> 00:00:58.887
Mo shrugged. "I—"

12
00:00:58.888 --> 00:01:02.024
Octo didn't wait for Mo to finish.

13
00:01:02.025 --> 00:01:06.273
"I'm strong and fast," Octo said.

14
00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:08.866
"I like the color purple.

15
00:01:08.867 --> 00:01:12.918
But I don't like sharks or eels!"

16
00:01:12.919 --> 00:01:18.479
"Wow," Mo said. "You talk a lot."

17
00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:26.086
Cora sighed. "Yes, he does."

18
00:01:26.087 --> 00:01:31.150
Just then an angelfish swam over. "Cora!"

19
00:01:31.151 --> 00:01:34.273
"What's wrong, Andy?" Cora asked.

20
00:01:34.274 --> 00:01:41.160
"I can't find the young angelfish," Andy said.

21
00:01:41.161 --> 00:01:44.490
"I saw them!" Octo said.

22
00:01:44.491 --> 00:01:47.284
"You did?" Cora said.

23
00:01:47.285 --> 00:01:49.101
Octo grinned.

24
00:01:49.102 --> 00:01:52.217
"They were looking for a place to play.

25
00:01:52.218 --> 00:01:55.734
I told them to go to Rock Canyon.

26
00:01:55.735 --> 00:01:58.421
You said it's your favorite place."

27
00:01:58.422 --> 00:02:01.584
Cora groaned.

28
00:02:01.585 --> 00:02:05.761
"I said it's my least favorite place.

29
00:02:05.762 --> 00:02:09.156
Rock Canyon is dangerous!"

30
00:02:09.157 --> 00:02:14.837
Octo gulped. "Oops."

